==Battleground==
*5 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*5 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Nana & Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Zroco]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**3 [[Zigge]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**1 [[Zir Zeal]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Any [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|Anti-Zombie]] or [[Zombie Killer]] Cat can easily deal with the [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie Enemies]] here. The main threat is Nana & Doge, as she has 120,000 health and 5,000 damage as well as a guaranteed chance to cause a mini-wave to slow Cat units. Using any [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Shield Cats]] can instantly nullify her mini-wave, allowing your attacking units to deal mass damage to her.

